    {
      "id": "yuan-291",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调沉醉东风",
      "subtitle": "面比花枝解语",
      "author": "关汉卿",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "面比花枝解语，眉横柳叶长疏。想着雨和云，朝还暮，但开口只是长吁。\n纸鹞儿休将人厮应付，肯不肯怀儿里便许。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e83512e11b6c1598540c3b6557ca6c37294e0f8c4a64bff02a07ab893dadc2c3",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-291--e83512e11b6c1598540c3b6557ca6c37294e0f8c4a64bff02a07ab893dadc2c3.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-292",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调沉醉东风",
      "subtitle": "忧则忧鸾孤凤单",
      "author": "关汉卿",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "忧则忧鸾孤凤单，愁则愁月缺花残，为则为俏冤家，害则害谁曾惯，瘦则瘦不似今番，恨则恨孤帏绣衾寒，怕则怕黄昏到老。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e3b66ca8201eae476f68ca461b45da65877db716762664caaab14554a8a3e555",
      "estimatedOutput": 710,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-292--e3b66ca8201eae476f68ca461b45da65877db716762664caaab14554a8a3e555.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-293",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调沉醉东风",
      "subtitle": "伴夜月银筝凤闲",
      "author": "关汉卿",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "伴夜月银筝凤闲，暖东风绣被常悭。信沉了鱼，书绝了雁，盼雕鞍万水千山。\n本利对相思若不还，则告与那能索债愁眉泪眼。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "bf687ea4bd6d49db0f98b61a5be6049735da67ae7256032a2e389770a7d97dda",
      "estimatedOutput": 712,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-293--bf687ea4bd6d49db0f98b61a5be6049735da67ae7256032a2e389770a7d97dda.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-294",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "四块玉·南吕·闲适",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "关汉卿",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "【其一】\n适意行，安心坐。渴时饮，饥时餐，醉时歌。困来时就向莎茵卧。日月长，天地阔，闲快活。\n【其二】\n旧酒投，新醅泼。老瓦盆边笑呵呵，共山僧野叟闲吟各。他出一对鸡，我出一个鹅，闲快活。\n【其三】\n意马收，心猿锁。跳出红尘恶风波。槐阴午梦谁惊破。离了利名声，钻入安乐窝，闲快活。\n【其四】\n南亩耕，东山卧。世态人情经历多。闲将往事思量过，贤的是他，愚的是我，争什么！",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b97df3f806e91a9070109cc825c1ca53a9a98f18e4205b75f85a79571d05c761",
      "estimatedOutput": 966,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-294--b97df3f806e91a9070109cc825c1ca53a9a98f18e4205b75f85a79571d05c761.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-295",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·水仙子·夜雨",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "一声梧叶一声秋，一点芭蕉一点愁，三更归梦三更后。落灯花，棋未收，叹新丰逆旅淹留。枕上十年事，江南二老忧，都到心头。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3c9ec13c58d6e4946d613f24fb4d65829c0ff1e3892b1092948f34040a116b91",
      "estimatedOutput": 714,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-295--3c9ec13c58d6e4946d613f24fb4d65829c0ff1e3892b1092948f34040a116b91.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-296",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "水仙子·春情",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "九分恩爱九分忧，两处相思两处愁，十年迤逗十年受。\n几遍成几遍休，半点事半点惭羞。\n三秋恨三秋感旧，三春怨三春病酒，一世害一世风流。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "67dfb0572c775648b759499dbeba519c59d1b3262aa5006187b7c70402883918",
      "estimatedOutput": 730,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-296--67dfb0572c775648b759499dbeba519c59d1b3262aa5006187b7c70402883918.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-297",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "殿前欢·观音山眠松",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "老苍龙，避乖高卧此山中。岁寒心不肯为梁栋，翠婉蜓俯仰相从。\n秦皇旧日封，靖节何年种？丁固当时梦。半溪明月，一枕清风。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "dd38092db95da394d23fc81cb6b2b1a9d1e0effbf006af24c7cd0840dd1cbbf4",
      "estimatedOutput": 716,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-297--dd38092db95da394d23fc81cb6b2b1a9d1e0effbf006af24c7cd0840dd1cbbf4.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-298",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "仙吕·一半儿",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "【病酒】\n昨宵中酒懒扶头，今日看花惟袖手，害酒愁花人问羞。病根由，一半儿因花一半儿酒。\n【落花】\n河阳香散唤提壶，金谷魂消啼鹧鸪，隋苑春归闻杜宇。片红无，一半儿狂风一半儿雨。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e015b8c8dd79c59f92d75bfe0655f319517f7d6693a1959152e05d33ca381db0",
      "estimatedOutput": 774,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-298--e015b8c8dd79c59f92d75bfe0655f319517f7d6693a1959152e05d33ca381db0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-299",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "黄钟·人月圆·甘露怀古",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "江皋楼观前朝寺，秋色入秦淮。败垣芳草，空廊落叶，深砌苍苔。远人南去，夕阳西下，江水东来。木兰花在，山僧试问，知为谁开？",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "dd8e12e341981cb07773a0fff8a732e71f0b5a6cf76b235c77924e5a42dabbf4",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-299--dd8e12e341981cb07773a0fff8a732e71f0b5a6cf76b235c77924e5a42dabbf4.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-300",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·蟾宫曲·西湖寻春",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "徐再思",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "清明春色三分：湖上行舟，陌上行人。一片花阴，两行柳影，十里莎茵。不要多肴排一品，休嫌少酒止三巡。处处开樽，步步寻春。花下归来，带月敲门。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3ffa8d985443d3896ab9f80f8d70dc2f7fe7862d11ad7a3a3cfe26c1feb9b53d",
      "estimatedOutput": 736,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-300--3ffa8d985443d3896ab9f80f8d70dc2f7fe7862d11ad7a3a3cfe26c1feb9b53d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-301",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "正宫·小梁州·春怀",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "任昱",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "落花无数满汀洲，转眼春休。绿阴枝上杜鹃愁，空拖逗，白了少年头。[么]朝朝寒食笙歌奏，百年间有限风流。玳瑁筵，葡萄酒，殷勤红袖，莫惜捧金瓯。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "07a907249d3d52cfd01e7512213b3fa3b732fe1745a9b8a640ba9e9c2eb3c642",
